Cell["\<\
MPSSchmidtValues implicitly canonicalizes the MPS, so the entropy is \
invariant under the choice of an existing canonical form:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->650727001,ExpressionUUID->"ca009621-14ba-4ae8-93b5-7c6801cd100e"],

